Mixed Rights Non-Commercial Notice for ALD/E-ImageMiner

This repository contains annotations, generated metadata, extracted figure
images, code, and documentation for the ALD/E-ImageMiner benchmark.

The repository is distributed as a mixed-rights, non-commercial benchmark
resource. Dataset annotations and generated metadata are released under
CC BY 4.0 unless a more specific file-level notice says otherwise. No blanket
open license is granted for all figure images, source-paper content, or other
third-party material. Figure images originate from many scientific
publications and may carry article-specific copyrights or reuse terms.

Source article PDFs are intentionally excluded from the GitHub release.
This release is intended for non-commercial research, benchmarking, and
evaluation use. Users are responsible for checking each source article and
rights holder terms before reusing, redistributing, or commercially using
any image or source-derived content.

The rights granularity is record/image-level rather than corpus-level. Each
extracted figure image and source-derived paper field follows the rights and
reuse terms of its corresponding source article. The Hugging Face dataset
package mirrors this policy with license metadata set to "other" /
"mixed-rights-non-commercial" and per-record metadata_license,
image_license, and image_reuse_status fields using values such as
"CC BY 4.0", "source_publisher_rights_reserved", and
"non_commercial_research_use_only".

Where an individual file or subdirectory includes a separate license notice,
that notice applies to that file or subdirectory.
